{"speciesId":637,"names":{"fr":"Pyrax","es":"Volcarona","en":"Volcarona","ja":"ウルガモス"},"descriptions":[{"language":"fr","version":"black","text":"On dit que quand le ciel s’est obscurci à cause des cendres d’un volcan, le feu d’un Pyrax aurait remplacé le soleil."},{"language":"en","version":"black","text":"When volcanic ash darkened the atmosphere, it is said that Volcarona’s fire provided a replacement for the sun."},{"language":"fr","version":"white","text":"Quand il se bat, il fait pleuvoir des écailles enflammées de ses six ailes et transforme les alentours en mer de feu."},{"language":"en","version":"white","text":"A sea of fire engulfs the surroundings of their battles, since they use their six wings to scatter their ember scales."},{"language":"en","version":"black-2","text":"Thought to be an embodiment of the sun, it appeared during a bitterly cold winter and saved Pokémon from freezing."},{"language":"en","version":"white-2","text":"Thought to be an embodiment of the sun, it appeared during a bitterly cold winter and saved Pokémon from freezing."},{"language":"fr","version":"x","text":"Quand il se bat, il fait pleuvoir des écailles enflammées de ses six ailes et transforme les alentours en mer de feu."},{"language":"es","version":"x","text":"Cuando combate, despide escamas ardientes de sus seis alas y genera un mar ígneo a su alrededor."},{"language":"en","version":"x","text":"A sea of fire engulfs the surroundings of their battles, since they use their six wings to scatter their ember scales."},{"language":"ja","version":"x","text":"戦いになると ６枚の 羽から 火の粉の りんぷんを まき散らして あたり 一面を 火の海にする。"},{"language":"fr","version":"y","text":"On dit que quand le ciel s’est obscurci à cause des cendres d’un volcan, le feu d’un Pyrax aurait remplacé le soleil."},{"language":"es","version":"y","text":"Antaño, las cenizas volcánicas cubrieron los cielos. Entonces, sus llamaradas sirvieron de sol."},{"language":"en","version":"y","text":"When volcanic ash darkened the atmosphere, it is said that Volcarona’s fire provided a replacement for the sun."},{"language":"ja","version":"y","text":"火山灰で 地上が 真っ暗に なったとき ウルガモスの 炎が 太陽の かわりに なったという。"},{"language":"fr","version":"omega-ruby","text":"Quand il se bat, il fait pleuvoir des écailles enflammées de ses six ailes et transforme les alentours en mer de feu."},{"language":"es","version":"omega-ruby","text":"Cuando combate, despide escamas ardientes de sus seis alas y genera un mar ígneo a su alrededor."},{"language":"en","version":"omega-ruby","text":"A sea of fire engulfs the surroundings of their battles, since they use their six wings to scatter their ember scales."},{"language":"ja","version":"omega-ruby","text":"戦いになると ６枚の 羽から 火の粉の りんぷんを まき散らして あたり 一面を 火の海にする。"},{"language":"fr","version":"alpha-sapphire","text":"On dit que quand le ciel s’est obscurci à cause des cendres d’un volcan, le feu d’un Pyrax aurait remplacé le soleil."},{"language":"es","version":"alpha-sapphire","text":"Antaño, las cenizas volcánicas cubrieron los cielos. Entonces, sus llamaradas sirvieron de sol."},{"language":"en","version":"alpha-sapphire","text":"When volcanic ash darkened the atmosphere, it is said that Volcarona’s fire provided a replacement for the sun."},{"language":"ja","version":"alpha-sapphire","text":"火山灰で 地上が 真っ暗に なったとき ウルガモスの 炎が 太陽の かわりに なったという。"},{"language":"fr","version":"ultra-sun","text":"Il décrit des cercles dans le ciel en faisant pleuvoir des écailles enflammées. Il était jadis surnommé « le courroux solaire »."},{"language":"es","version":"ultra-sun","text":"Esparce escamas flamígeras a medida que surca el cielo. Era temido por la gente de tiempo ha, que lo apodaron la Ira del Sol."},{"language":"en","version":"ultra-sun","text":"As it flies, it scatters its flaming scales. It was feared by ancient people, who referred to it as “the rage of the sun.”"},{"language":"ja","version":"ultra-sun","text":"炎の 鱗粉を 振りまきながら 飛びまわる。 古代の 人々は 太陽の怒りと 呼び 恐れた。"},{"language":"fr","version":"ultra-moon","text":"Selon la légende, il serait né d’un cocon de flammes et serait venu à la rescousse des humains et des Pokémon souffrant du froid."},{"language":"es","version":"ultra-moon","text":"Una leyenda relata cómo nació de un capullo en llamas para acudir al rescate de humanos y Pokémon ateridos por el frío."},{"language":"en","version":"ultra-moon","text":"According to legends, it was hatched from a flaming cocoon to save people and Pokémon that were suffering from the cold."},{"language":"ja","version":"ultra-moon","text":"燃え盛る 炎の繭から 生まれ 寒さに 苦しむ人や ポケモンを 救ったという 伝説が ある。"},{"language":"fr","version":"sword","text":"Certains disent qu’il répand ses écailles ardentes pour provoquer des incendies, d’autres, pour sauver ceux qui souffrent du froid."},{"language":"es","version":"sword","text":"Se dice que sus escamas flamígeras pueden tanto causar incendios como amparar a aquellos que sufren las inclemencias del frío."},{"language":"en","version":"sword","text":"Volcarona scatters burning scales. Some say it does this to start fires. Others say it’s trying to rescue those that suffer in the cold."},{"language":"ja","version":"sword","text":"炎の りんぷんを 振りまき 火事を 起こすとも 寒さに 苦しむものを 救うとも いう。"},{"language":"fr","version":"shield","text":"Né d’un cocon enflammé, ce Pokémon apparaît sur d’anciennes fresques représenté comme une divinité du feu."},{"language":"es","version":"shield","text":"Nace de una pupa envuelta en llamas. En algunas pinturas rupestres aparece representado como una deidad del fuego."},{"language":"en","version":"shield","text":"This Pokémon emerges from a cocoon formed of raging flames. Ancient murals depict Volcarona as a deity of fire."},{"language":"ja","version":"shield","text":"燃えさかる 炎の 繭から 生まれる。 古代の 壁画に 炎の神として 描かれている。"}],"varieties":[{"id":637,"moves":[{"name":"gust","learns":[[11,"level-up",1],[11,"level-up",20],[14,"level-up",1],[14,"level-up",20],[15,"level-up",1],[15,"level-up",20],[16,"level-up",1],[16,"level-up",20],[17,"level-up",1],[17,"level-up",20],[18,"level-